{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんわかつき。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の握手会の\nお洋服レポさんだよ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕張メッセ、お越しくださった皆様本当にありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天気も悪くなり、寒いし\n大変でしたよね。すみません、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも本当に本当に楽しい握手会でした。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆さんに会えてよかった。本当。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日来れなかった方も、\n是非いつか一度会いにきてね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"待ってます。実物にあってお話してみませんか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、今日のスタイルチェック！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まずこちら。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼タイトめのチェック柄ワンピース／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアは、ドッグイヤー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次はこちら"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼制服バージョン1／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアはツインテールとハーフアップ！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0005.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"続いては"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼制服バージョン2／\n通せんぼっ！！！どーん！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアはこちらです。ゆる巻"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いかがですか？照"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また会いに来てくれますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最後に\n琴子ちゃんと写メ撮ったお。\n緊張するーって言ってて可愛すぎました。\nお話久しぶりにして\n喜んでくれて嬉しかったの(((o(*ﾟ▽ﾟ*)o)))"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2014/02/11/2780310/0008.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみ！"}],"source":"archive"}